WEBVTT

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:02.410
Hurry!

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:05.470
Holy Guard and Holy Psalm 
take the right wing.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.560
Holy Blade take the left.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.800
The cavalry will lead the attack.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.150
Hold attack formation
and head to the front line.

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:19.460
Show the Black Army
the true might of the Holy Blade!

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:22.620
Einslotte, status?

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:26.330
Given the scale of the operation,
it will take some more time.

00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:30.990
I'm told we've also lost contact 
with the Sage's Tower.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:34.960
Yes, ever since they informed us that 
they'd be setting out in the Ark.

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:36.960
But they will come.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.290
We're going to trust them
and do everything we can.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.150
Yes, ma'am.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:45.940
What is that?

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:48.100
The Ark?

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:34.650
Your Majesty, what's going on?

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.230
According to our plans,

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:37.230
the barrier was supposed to have been 
neutralized as soon as the Ark arrived.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.590
This is not good.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:58.440
Furball!

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:04.700
Aram.

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:05.970
Musica.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.290
You're safe.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.910
As if we'd go down that easily.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:11.000
Guys...

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.330
I thought we were done for.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:17.330
But...

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:18.770
Phoena's...

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:23.420
We can rescue her after 
we take out the Black King.

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.950
The battle's only beginning.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:28.060
Right.

00:04:29.090 --> 00:04:30.130
Musica.

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:31.140
Leave it to me.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.500
Furball, take care of Musica.

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.590
We'll also fight alongside you here.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:40.300
Let's hurry up and get that barrier down.

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:43.440
The guys waiting outside 
must be getting impatient.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:45.850
We'll push through to the Imperial Castle.

00:04:45.850 --> 00:04:48.450
Understood. I'll give it all I've got.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.490
Can't wait. I like a good challenge.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:52.710
We're gonna save them.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.480
Both Yuri and Phoena.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.860
Let's get this show back on the road!

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:48.970
This song...

00:05:52.890 --> 00:05:53.900
Your Majesty.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.980
All troops, charge!

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:26.900
What an annoying song.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:30.700
Why do this when they know they'll lose again?

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:33.720
They never learn.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.590
Ridiculous.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:58.220
Thank you for accommodating my request.

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:04.170
Ancient magic passed down through
the family of the Chronicle's caretakers.

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:06.300
That was quite interesting.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:11.350
I've made some adjustments to 
maximize its effectiveness.

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:16.300
Therefore, should you use the seal,
your life will be forfeit.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:18.410
I understand.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:21.720
In a way, this represents my resolve.

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:32.490
Yuri.

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:34.110
Please!

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:35.610
Snap out of it!

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:37.350
Yuri!

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.610
Take the Chronicle to the King.

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:47.980
No!

00:07:50.420 --> 00:07:51.950
Yuri...

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:53.180
Stop.

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:54.950
It's no use.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:57.750
He has already become blackness incarnate.

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:00.940
Your words will not reach him.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.600
I've found you.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:19.380
I knew you were hiding here, winged sprite.

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:20.830
No...

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:22.200
Pirika?

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.870
There's nowhere left to hide.

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:30.800
With this, all hope will be lost,

00:08:30.800 --> 00:08:33.680
and the world will be engulfed in darkness.

00:08:35.250 --> 00:08:38.260
Why do you seek to destroy the world?

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:42.500
What good does that do you, Black King?

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:46.640
Answer me, Father!

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:54.190
Too slow.

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.260
Bring it on!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.780
Well, at least he's having fun.

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:08.080
Aram!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:14.130
Freeze!

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:16.630
Its leg!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:24.210
Get going, Aram!

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:27.190
We'll leave Yuri up to you!

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:30.810
Don't you dare forget what you told me!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.050
Aram...

00:09:39.400 --> 00:09:44.040
The white light that child emits is an eyesore.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:51.050
But that's why he would be especially 
powerful if he were to be dyed black.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:53.040
Black Knight.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.670
I know.

00:09:56.670 --> 00:10:00.280
It's my job to fight him.

00:10:04.470 --> 00:10:06.180
Our left flank is weakening.

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.530
Send in the Holy Mark to reinforce them.

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:09.430
Yes, Your Majesty!

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:11.690
Musica's song is our anthem!

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:14.440
Follow it to victory!

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:20.680
Looks like you've started to
 get the hang of it, Princess.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:31.130
Don't let your guard down, old man.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:32.840
Who are you calling an old man?

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:34.970
Look.

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:46.220
It's about time to end this.

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:50.250
Don't falter.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.360
Go!

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.480
I'm taking you down!

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.160
Very well.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.080
Let's settle this.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:14.950
This simply won't do.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:19.970
Her Majesty, the Holy Queen herself,
shouldn't be on the front lines.

00:11:19.970 --> 00:11:20.910
Your Majesty!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.420
I thought you were fighting <i>me</i>.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:27.900
Burckhardt...

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:48.670
You're looking well.

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:54.000
Has leaving the Suppression Army
in Aram's hands

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:58.370
lightened your burden, Holy Queen?

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:07.220
I suppose.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:09.370
You admit it?

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.330
Yes. I'll admit it.

00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:14.090
It seems I was never fit for this after all.

00:12:14.990 --> 00:12:22.880
But, that being the case, 
I've decided I have to do what I can.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:27.420
What you can, you say?

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.870
It's too late.

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:34.450
It's your naivety that made me like this!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:50.310
Are you still trying avoid responsibility 
for your actions?

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:55.000
I'm not trying to avoid anything.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:58.400
Certainly, I was probably responsible 
for allowing this to happen.

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:00.660
But you see, Burckhardt,

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:08.150
a person's strengths and weaknesses 
are ultimately their own.

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:14.660
We all have to come to terms 
with that in our lives.

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:22.680
Nothing meaningful can come of
basing your self-worth on others.

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:25.340
Nonsense!

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:47.900
The Holy Knight who wore that is no more.

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:50.700
He was an exemplary knight.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:53.430
I wish he would have stayed to help me.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:55.740
Juliana...

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.310
You...

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:04.170
I've already decided
I won't run from anything.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:07.870
If it's my fault that you've ended up this way,

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:12.890
then I'll end you myself.

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:19.680
That's the way I take responsibility.

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:31.950
Congratulations, Burckhardt.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.950
You're a member of the Holy Guard now.

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:36.890
Sir.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.570
Thank you.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:42.780
You were at the top of
the selection exams, I see.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:45.250
Do you have a preferred post?

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:49.050
I will become a member of
the King's Sword someday.

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:52.550
I hope to serve Juliana.

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:55.170
You want to become one of us?

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:57.240
I like your determination.

00:14:57.240 --> 00:14:59.560
She's a rewarding person to serve.

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:01.930
I believe so, too.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.820
<i>That's right.</i>

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:40.370
<i>I...</i>

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.440
The Chronicle...

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:27.930
Now...

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:31.620
It's the beginning of the end.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:33.650
New enemies.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.000
What?!

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:51.670
The blackness is getting stronger.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.430
What have you done?

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:07.170
Looks like I really have to...

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:25.550
Yuri.

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:29.660
I've abandoned that name.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:36.650
I'm bringing you back, 
even if I have to beat you down.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:37.590
Yuri!

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:43.010
I can't hear Musica's song.

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:43.930
Don't tell me...

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:48.970
I looked up to you.

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:51.540
You were the one who brought me this far.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:54.410
How could you end up like this?

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:59.620
Say something, Yuri!

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:03.690
I told you, I've abandoned that name.

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:09.870
Right.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:12.360
You ran away.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:18.710
Traveling with you, I came to
understand you a little bit.

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:22.080
There are all kinds of people around you.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.230
They all depend on you.

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:28.070
And so you tried to live up to them.

00:18:28.610 --> 00:18:30.240
To their expectations.

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:31.920
All of them.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:34.650
Isn't that right?

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:38.530
Even I expected great things from you.

00:18:38.980 --> 00:18:43.290
I had no idea how much of 
a burden that was on you.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:46.200
But listen, Yuri,

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:51.370
you don’t need to live up to the expectations
of each and every person.

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:53.680
Just be yourself!

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:56.520
Just do what you want to do!

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:58.160
Tell me, Yuri!

00:18:58.160 --> 00:18:59.970
What is it that you want to do?

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:03.710
I desire nothing.

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:10.730
All I have now is my black destiny.

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:15.710
The impulse to destroy everything
and end it all.

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.330
Juliana, look!

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.610
The barrier...

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:33.820
We'll lose our line of retreat
if it regenerates!

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:40.720
Damn it.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:44.000
How did you end up this way?

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:45.140
Damn it, Yuri!

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:50.100
Your sword, your words...
they lack weight.

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:54.610
Strength is meaningless without resolve.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:58.030
Can you kill him?

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:03.490
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:06.570
I'm going to bring Yuri back.

00:20:06.570 --> 00:20:08.500
I'm going to make him come to his senses.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.070
We're gonna save them.

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:15.870
<i>No one would fear falling to the blackness
if words were all it took to stop it.</i>

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:18.560
<i>That won't cut it.</i>

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.510
<i>It's not enough.</i>

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:24.050
<i>I need to be prepared to kill.</i>

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:26.230
<i>To be killed.</i>

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:29.270
<i>And then some.</i>

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:34.930
<i>But can I do it?</i>

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:39.610
You never had a chance.

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:42.220
There was no way you could defeat
the power of blackness.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:44.950
Now, give it up.

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:48.620
No, I will never...

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:49.910
...give up!

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:52.220
It's not whether I can do it or not.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:56.590
I <i>will</i> do it!

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:04.350
We must support them with all our strength.

00:21:04.350 --> 00:21:07.080
Stay strong, and we can still win.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:08.420
Yes.

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:11.880
Show them what the Holy Guard is made of.

00:21:11.880 --> 00:21:16.550
You're no match to our united strength.

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:21.170
Is that what you call
the strength of bonds?

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:23.680
Gross.

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:31.030
I'll break them for you!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:35.760
Juliana!

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:49.480
Shuza?

00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:50.800
Why?

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.550
Charge!

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.060
The next blow...

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:06.340
...will settle this.
